   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "«Costumava» + infinitive",
     "texto": [
      "**Costumava** (used to) + infinitive: **Costumava ir à praia** (used to go to the beach). It is the imperfect of **costumar** (to be in the habit of).",
      "**Antigamente** (in the past) usually goes at the start: **Antigamente, nadava muito** (in the past, I swam a lot)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "«Estava a» + infinitive",
     "texto": [
      "In the past, **estava a** + infinitive shows an action that was going on: **Estava a trabalhar** (I was working).",
      "Like the present (**estou a trabalhar**, I am working), but with **estava**."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
